message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "POSEIDON ensemble data assimilation (poseidon_da)"
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of an ensemble Kalman filter / smoother for data
  assimilation with the POSEIDON radionuclide transport model. This record
  describes the software implementation; the underlying scientific method
  should be cited separately from its authoritative publication.
